; AlgoX SuperTrend Pro EA - preset M5_B_Trend_Momentum
; M5: trend + momentum (M30 filter)
; family: trend | hard filters: InpTrendFilterMode, InpMACDMode, InpMaxSpreadPoints>0
; status: rejected
; The trend + momentum combination on M5: the M30 trend is required, the MACD histogram is required, the 55/45 RSI levels and the intraday regime score, and the exit is TP2 with the break-even trigger. ATR(5) gate 2.0 USD and a 6 bar cooldown keep the trade count and the cost drag down.
; Generated by generate_presets.py - do not edit by hand.
; Copy to MQL4/Presets and load it from the Inputs tab (Load button).
; Coherence rules: max 2 hard filters per family, max 5 in total,
; everything else inside a family stays on score so the filters do not fight each other.

